# .trivyignore
# Security vulnerability suppressions with documented mitigations and upstream status.

# CVE-2026-40976: Spring Boot security bypass due to ineffective default web security auto-configuration.
# Upstream status: Fixed in 4.0.6 which is not yet available in public Maven repositories.
# Application mitigation: MetricHive completely overrides Spring Boot default web security by providing
# an explicit, customized SecurityFilterChain and RateLimitFilter for API authentication, eliminating
# reliance on the vulnerable default fallback security configuration.
CVE-2026-40976
